WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:09.600
Mr. Sulu,

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:11.800
remind me never to piss you off

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:18.000
Dad, dad, did Eagles win?!

00:00:18.050 --> 00:00:21.400
Philadelphia beat Washington by a score of

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:24.200
24 to 16 last Sunday.

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:28.000
You're gonna need a bigger boat.

00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:31.800
I didn't find any boat rental and charter services.

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:33.600
Oh yeah, you can milk anything with nipples.

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:35.000
I have nipples, Greg.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:36.400
Could you milk me?

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:38.400
I found 15 groceries.

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:40.400
Fourteen of them are fairly close to you.

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:43.200
Don't mess with me, Porkchop.

00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:45.000
What day is this?

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:49.200
It's Thursday, November 21st, 2013.

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:51.600
*Singing*

00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:54.200
Would somebody please give me directions?!

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:56.400
Where would you like to go?

00:00:56.400 --> 00:00:58.400
What is your quest?

00:00:58.400 --> 00:01:00.400
To seek the Holy Grail.

00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:04.800
What is the airspeed velocity of an unladen swallow?

00:01:04.800 --> 00:01:07.800
About 25mph for a European swallow.

00:01:07.800 --> 00:01:11.600
You have to know these things when you're a virtual assistant, you know?

00:01:11.600 --> 00:01:15.800
Play it, Sam. Play "As Time Goes By."

00:01:15.800 --> 00:01:19.800
I couldn't find "It Sam Play As Time Goes" in your music.

00:01:19.800 --> 00:01:23.400
I guess it comes down to a simple choice really.

00:01:25.600 --> 00:01:30.000
Get busy livin' or get busy dyin'.

00:01:30.400 --> 00:01:32.800
I don't know how to respond to that.

00:01:32.800 --> 00:01:36.400
Note to self: I don't want to live!

00:01:36.600 --> 00:01:39.400
Here is your note: I don't want to live.

00:01:39.400 --> 00:01:41.000
RUNNNN!!!!

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:43.000
GOOOOO!!!

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:45.000
Get to the chopper!!!

00:01:45.600 --> 00:01:48.400
Okay, here's a place matching "The Chopper."

00:01:48.400 --> 00:01:51.000
It looks pretty close to you.

